        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matthew Tishler, Rowan Blanchard, Sabrina Carpenter, Paul Hoen, Paris Berelc\n- Works: Girl Meets World, \"Take On The World\", Invisible Sister\n\nFacts:\n- Rowan Blanchard was born on October 14, 2001.\n- Rowan Blanchard is an American actress.\n- Matthew Tishler produced and co-wrote the Girl Meets World theme song \"Take On The World\".\n- Sabrina Carpenter and Rowan Blanchard performed the Girl Meets World theme song \"Take On The World\".\n- Paul Hoen directed the film Invisible Sister.\n- Invisible Sister stars Rowan Blanchard and Paris Berelc.",
